  "additional_root_corrections_reviewed": [
    "Propose intent adds the new fixed-current-base purpose without changing prior purpose policy.",
    "Explicit isolation confirmation requires a present PAUSE field, including omitted-field negative.",
    "New binding disallows all seven unrelated recovery proof SHA families.",
    "Exact new-family generated if conditions replace stale variants; unrelated policy guards retained.",
    "Broad eligible-claim filtering was replaced by exact independently proved isolation exclusions; appended foreign claims remain rejected."
  ],
  "baseline_revision": "e309f0ba7418569010b942cc4374f7fe243090a5",
  "checked_invariants": [
    "Old knowledge transport remains UNKNOWN; no old no-start/stop receipt is backfilled.",
    "Exact ENGINEERING plan confirmation is exclusive and creates PAUSE; distinct public RESUME is required.",
    "Same Requirement/Task/base/source/branch/worktree and complete dirty/inherited patches/progress are retained.",
    "Legacy isolation consumes one ordinary attempt, creates a new WorkItem/claim, and never refunds unknown work.",
    "Prospective positive admission refusal retains same attempt and original WorkItem with dispatch+1, new claim/Run/Context.",
    "Task lock, queue authority, SQL current-row/claim/generation/budget and active-owner fences remain required.",
    "Historical isolation reopens full binding/plan/authorization/original journal/context/claim bytes before affecting other proof consumers.",
    "Store-only BaselineOperatorAuthorization has no published schema; its typed/exact-plan/store checks were reviewed without claiming schema coverage.",
    "No candidate or QA/Review result can be granted by these proof/authority families."
